  "notes": "FORMATION: ⟦{総|そう}→総〜：03958_sou⟧ (total, overall) + ⟦{計|けい}→計：02691_kei⟧ (count, calculate).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {総計|そうけい}⟦で→で：00502_de⟧: in total\n- {総計|そうけい}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to total up, to calculate the sum\n- {総計|そうけい}⟦{金額|きんがく}→金額：02665_kingaku⟧: total amount\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {総計|そうけい}: grand total (formal, comprehensive)\n- ⟦{合計|ごうけい}→合計：02817_goukei⟧: total, sum (more common in everyday use)\n- ⟦{累計|るいけい}→累計：08327_ruikei⟧: cumulative total (accumulated over time)\n- ⟦{総額|そうがく}→総額：05472_sougaku⟧: total amount (specifically for money)",
